{
  "declaredLength": 9320,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "FAUT QU’ON PARLE !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00460041005500540020005100552019004F004E0020005000410052004C00450020002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai trouvé une Poké Ball piratée.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A201900610069002000740072006F0075007600E900200075006E006500200050006F006B00E9002000420061006C006C00200070006900720061007400E90065002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Une Poké Ball piratée ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E006500200050006F006B00E9002000420061006C006C00200070006900720061007400E900650020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qu’est-ce que ça veut dire ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100752019006500730074002D006300650020007100750065002000E7006100200076006500750074002000640069007200650020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’était un des champs d’études de la Team Flare.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLe but était de développer un virus informatique\npour empêcher d’utiliser une Poké Ball.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 145
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ouais, c’était pas du joli. Imagine ce qui serait\narrivé à Kalos si ça avait marché.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais j’vais pas m’étendre plus que ça.\nJ’ai du boulot pour toi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061006900730020006A2019007600610069007300200070006100730020006D201900E900740065006E00640072006500200070006C007500730020007100750065002000E70061002E000A004A20190061006900200064007500200062006F0075006C006F007400200070006F0075007200200074006F00690020002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La Poké Ball piratée renferme un Pokémon\nfabuleux du nom de <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Volcanion<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Comment un Pokémon aussi rare a pu se retrouver\ndans une Poké Ball ? Ça, j’en sais que dalle.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais quoi qu’il en soit, j’aimerais le sortir de là,\net tu vas me donner un coup de main !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quand Volcanion sera libéré, capture-le avec\nune Poké Ball qui fonctionne, cette fois !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Fais-moi signe quand tu seras prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe à capturer\nVolcanion !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0046006100690073002D006D006F00690020007300690067006E00650020007100750061006E006400200074007500200073006500720061007300200070007200EA007400100003110000FF01000065002000E0002000630061007000740075007200650072000A0056006F006C00630061006E0069006F006E0020002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors ? Prêt<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe à capturer Volcanion ?\nOn y va ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006F007200730020003F00200050007200EA007400100003110000FF01000065002000E000200063006100700074007500720065007200200056006F006C00630061006E0069006F006E0020003F000A004F006E002000790020007600610020003F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On y va !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006E00200079002000760061002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas tout de suite...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007300200074006F00750074002000640065002000730075006900740065002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dépêche-toi ! Volcanion attend qu’on lui vienne\nen aide !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400E9007000EA006300680065002D0074006F00690020002100200056006F006C00630061006E0069006F006E00200061007400740065006E00640020007100752019006F006E0020006C007500690020007600690065006E006E0065000A0065006E002000610069006400650020002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Super, parfait !\nBon, ben... c’est parti !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530075007000650072002C0020007000610072006600610069007400200021000A0042006F006E002C002000620065006E002E002E002E0020006320190065007300740020007000610072007400690020002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... Attends, on a un autre problème.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAprès avoir effacé le virus informatique, j’ai créé\nun outil pour ouvrir la Poké Ball sans la casser...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 148
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et... ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450074002E002E002E0020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh non, j’ai un mauvais pressentiment...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00680020006E006F006E002C0020006A20190061006900200075006E0020006D0061007500760061006900730020007000720065007300730065006E00740069006D0065006E0074002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Imagine le tableau : Volcanion, un Pokémon\nfabuleux surpuissant, enfermé dans une Poké Ball<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ndepuis des lustres...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJe te garantis qu’il va se déchaîner à la seconde\noù il sera libéré !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 194
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça a l’air risqué dit comme ça, mais t’inquiète.\nJ’ai appelé une spécialiste de Volcanion !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Une spécialiste ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E006500200073007000E9006300690061006C00690073007400650020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça existe, ça ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C700610020006500780069007300740065002C002000E700610020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eh oui, c’est moi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500680020006F00750069002C0020006320190065007300740020006D006F00690020002100100002011400300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai pris le chemin le plus court depuis les Éditions\nd’Illumis pour venir jusqu’ici !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nCourir dans toutes les rues de la ville m’a permis\nde la connaître comme ma poche !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 178
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yvonne est éditrice adjointe aux Éditions d’Illumis.\nElle a trouvé un mémo top secret sur Volcanion.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Voici comment l’auteur de ce mémo décrit\nla puissance de Volcanion :<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n« Puisque ce Pokémon peut faire sauter une\nmontagne entière grâce à ses explosions<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nde vapeur, il doit absolument posséder<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nun organe qui lui permet de faire bouillir<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ninstantanément l’eau dans son corps. »<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 289
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La personne continue en expliquant la mythologie\nautour du Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n« Dans le sud de la région, Volcanion est révéré\nen tant que Pokémon fondateur de Kalos.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nGrâce à des explosions de vapeur, il aurait façonné\nles plateaux où la population s’est installée pour<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nconstruire les villes. »<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 298
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il doit être absolument surpuissant !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 5436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006C00200064006F00690074002000EA0074007200650020006100620073006F006C0075006D0065006E00740020007300750072007000750069007300730061006E00740020002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nous avons effectivement des preuves qu’une\nexplosion d’origine inconnue aurait pulvérisé<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nune chaîne de montagnes dans le sud de Kalos...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 5520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 145
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et l’origine inconnue, ce serait Volcanion ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 5812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500740020006C2019006F0072006900670069006E006500200069006E0063006F006E006E00750065002C002000630065002000730065007200610069007400200056006F006C00630061006E0069006F006E0020003F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ça me rassure pas sur ce qu’il fera quand il\nsortira de la Poké Ball... Mais il faut le libérer !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 5912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Prochain arrêt : le sous-sol du labo !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 6116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500072006F0063006800610069006E002000610072007200EA00740020003A0020006C006500200073006F00750073002D0073006F006C0020006400750020006C00610062006F0020002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿#",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 6204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00230000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> ! Tu m’entends ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 6216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002000210020005400750020006D20190065006E00740065006E006400730020003F00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’en fais pas, Yvonne et moi, on est avec toi !\nOn t’encourage de l’extérieur !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 6268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On serait bien venues avec toi, mais on tient à\nnotre peau, tu comprends ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 6436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Trêve de plaisanteries.\nLance la Poké Ball de Volcanion !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 6596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054007200EA0076006500200064006500200070006C0061006900730061006E007400650072006900650073002E000A004C0061006E006300650020006C006100200050006F006B00E9002000420061006C006C00200064006500200056006F006C00630061006E0069006F006E0020002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oups, il a l’air bien furax ! On a bien fait de garder\nnos distances. Oublie pas de le capturer, hein ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 6720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 108
    },
    {
      "displayText": "VOOOL !!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 6936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056004F004F004F004C00200021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿*",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 6956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je t’ai dit de le capturer !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 6968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020007420190061006900200064006900740020006400650020006C00650020006300610070007400750072006500720020002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 7036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et voilà, notre héro<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ́sïne a triomphé de Volcanion !\nTu vois, c’était pas si difficile.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 7048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est bizarre comme les Pokémon se calment\ndès qu’on les capture...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 7240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00432019006500730074002000620069007A006100720072006500200063006F006D006D00650020006C0065007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000730065002000630061006C006D0065006E0074000A006400E800730020007100752019006F006E0020006C0065007300200063006100700074007500720065002E002E002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿/",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 7384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh là là, je suis encore toute retournée d’avoir\nassisté à un combat contre un Pokémon fabuleux !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 7396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Maintenant que c’est fait... j’aimerais que tu me\nrendes un service.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTu pourrais demander à Volcanion de vaporiser\ndes immeubles pour faire une piste de course ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 7600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 169
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OK, non, ignore-la.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 7940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F004B002C0020006E006F006E002C002000690067006E006F00720065002D006C0061002E00100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Roooh, mais je plaisantais !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nUne chose est sûre, toute la rédac va m’envier\nl’article que je vais pondre sur cette aventure !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 7988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 133
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sur ce, je retourne aux Éditions d’Illumis !\nAu pas de course, bien sûr !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 8256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aujourd’hui encore, il reste des êtres privés de\nleur liberté à cause des crimes de la Team Flare.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nRegarde-moi, par exemple... Ce poste de directrice\nadjointe est une cage dorée, lui aussi.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 8412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 197
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Au moins, Volcanion a trouvé un<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe nouve<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ̂aulle\npartenaire !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 8808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100750020006D006F0069006E0073002C00200056006F006C00630061006E0069006F006E00200061002000740072006F0075007600E900200075006E00100003110000FF010000650020006E006F00750076006500100003110000FF030200610075006C006C0065000A00700061007200740065006E00610069007200650020002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "À tes côtés, je suis sûre qu’il va découvrir\ndes tas de nouvelles activités !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 8952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un peu comme le spectacle que vous m’avez\noffert, toi et ton équipe !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 9116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E002000700065007500200063006F006D006D00650020006C006500200073007000650063007400610063006C0065002000710075006500200076006F007500730020006D2019006100760065007A000A006F00660066006500720074002C00200074006F006900200065007400200074006F006E002000E9007100750069007000650020002100100002011400070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
